-- Reverse 0076 — drop the grants table.
--
-- LOSSY, and the loss is the comp records themselves: who was granted
-- Plus or Pro, why, by whom, and when it ended. Nothing recomputes
-- those. Before rolling this back on anything holding real grants,
-- dump the table — the workspaces keep whatever tier they currently
-- hold, but the next recompute has no floor to consult and drops every
-- comped workspace to Free (or to its paid tier, if it has one).
--
-- The forward migration's readers must be gone first: the recompute
-- paths in `billing-webhook.service.ts` and
-- `billing-reconciliation.sweep.ts` both reference `entitlement_grants`
-- and will error on a missing relation.
-- atlas:nolint destructive
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS "entitlement_grants";
